/tmp/claude-1007/-home-yixunhu-codespace-FLAC/1630c6fe-5d3e-42b4-94ec-1b6d3bcb0e4e/scratchpad/r3a/fresh_clone_merged/worklog/worklog_yixun/exp_25_depth_canon_claude/depth_canon_2026-10-26_01-08-27_codex_code_rC_review.log-5260-worklog/worklog_yixun/exp_25_depth_canon_claude/plan_depth_canon.md:69:  - **Canonical sidecar** `<metrics>.canon.json` (written whenever `--canonicalize`): per position `(i, target_id, dj, tie_class, canonical_depth_sha256)` where the hash is over `(D_canon + 0.0).contiguous().numpy().tobytes()` (float64; `+0.0` normalises signed zeros, which the rotation can flip at zero-depth pixels; bitwise-stable ⇒ equal across rotations), plus `canon_hash` = sha256 of the ordered tuple list (cell-specific: it contains `dj`), **`canonical_depth_hash`** = sha256 of the ordered `(target_id, canonical_depth_sha256)` pairs (rotation-invariant — the one-line Tier-1 equality for the collector; v9, r3a HIGH 2), and `tie_counts`. The exp_14 `.stream.json` contract is untouched.
